openclaw-channel-bitrix24
=========================

This plugin implements a Bitrix24 channel for OpenClaw using the imbot.v2 API
in fetch/poll mode (Path B), eliminating the webhook forgery risks present in
Path A (inbound webhook receiver).

This is a community plugin, not an official Bitrix24 or OpenClaw project.

The plugin was extracted from a pilot implementation and sanitized for public
release under the MIT license.

Key design principle: NO inbound HTTP surface. All communication is outbound
via polling, making webhook forgery structurally impossible.
